  "job_B15.5.37_20251003_114326": {
    "text": "\u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fee Osfer\u00f0 swade beard funde Adeluuolde biscop & Eadulfe abbod & Sumerlydan\nAn is Hudeman \u00e6t Asencircan, o\u00f0er is \u00e6lfuuard \u00e6t Dentune, III is Sumerlyde \u00e6t Stoce, IIII is O\u00f0ul \u00e6t\n\u00deis sind \u00fea festermen \u00fee Osfer\u00f0 & \u00feur funden Adeluuolde biscop & \u00e6lfrice cylde & Ealdulfe abbod on\nAn is Osfer\u00f0 himself, II Ealhstan \u00e6t Isslepe, III Wulno\u00f0 Strices sune, IIII is Sumerlyda \u00e6t Stoce, V is\n\u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fee Fri\u00f0olf & his bro\u00f0ra fundel \u00e6ldulfe abbod \u00e6t \u00feat lande \u00e6t Waltune \u00feat is\n\u00deonne is \u00feer borhhand, Frena & Wulno\u00f0 Clacces sune & \u00c6tlebrant \u00e6t Pilesgeate & Cnut & Styrcyr on\n\u00dea Ealdulf abbod bohte \u00feane toft \u00e6t Godinge on Waltune \u00fea was him boroh Vlf & Eincund & Grim on\n\u00dea Elfric ealdorman bohte \u00feat land \u00e6t Leobrantestune \u00e6t Frenan on ealles heres gemote on Hamtone \u00fee\n\u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fea Osgar funde Ealdulfe abbod \u00fea he bohte \u00feat land \u00e6t Macusie.\nAn Frena, II is Vlf Doddes sune, III is Osbern, IIII is Hundulf, V is Boia on Myletune, VI Wiulf Sunta\nFour & tuentig \u00e6cere is \u00fees wudes & IIXX h\u00ebredlandes buton o\u00f0rum gem\u00ebnum \u00fee Ealdulf abbod\n& he bohte \u00e6t Orme XII \u00e6ceras & was Vlf borhhand & Eincund & si\u00f0\u00f0on eal wepentac & \u00e6t Hungife\n\u00deis sint \u00fea festermen \u00fee Osgot funde Ealdulfe abbod \u00e6t \u00feet lande \u00e6t Castre \u00fee he geald him for \u00feam\n\u00deet is an toft & fourtig \u00e6cere herdelandes & m\u00e6dwe.\n\u00dees landes \u00e6t Wi\u00f0eringige is \u00fee Mannel sealde Adeluuolde biscop an hide buton anes oxangang.\n\u00deonne sint festermen, Gyreweard, Gyrping, \u00feurwold on Macusige & Steigncytel.\n\u00deonne sealde Clac ane hide buton anes oxangang.\n\u00deonne sint festermen, Oggod on Castre, Vlf Doddes suna, \u00feurwold \u00e6t Hylpestune, Clac on Castre.\n\u00deonne \u00e6t Vfige festermen, Vlf eorles suna & Cytelbearn & Osfer\u00f0 Fry\u00f0gistes suna & Clac \u00e6t\n\u00dee E\u00f0ered sealde Adeluuolde biscop synd festermen, Vlf Doddes suna, \u00feurwold \u00e6t Hylpestune, Clac on\nEaldulf abbod bohte \u00fea mylne \u00e6t Esctune mid twam pundum \u00e6t Martine & him sin festermen, Frena &\nHer geswutele\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t Ealdulf abbod gebohte ane hyde landes on Esctune \u00e6t Ealfuuolde on \u00feere III\n& him sin festermen & him festermen Osfer\u00f0 Fry\u00f0egystes suna & Byrcscige Warmundes suna &\n\u00dea Ethelwine ealdorman & Ealdulf abbod sealdon Ethestane & Ealfuuolde \u00feane latestan penign \u00e6t \u00feam\n\u00dees landes is XX \u00e6cera wudes an feldes butan \u00feere leswe \u00fee \u00feer to gebyri\u00f0 \u00fee Ealdulf abbod gebohte\n& him sind festermen, \u00feurlac & Herulf & Etlebrant & Hundulf.\nEaldulf abbod & Alfuuold Bohton o\u00f0er healfe hyde \u00e6t Swifte mid ehta pundun.\n\u00deonne synd festermen, Frena & Vlf eorles suna & Osfer\u00f0 Fry\u00f0egistes suna & Hudeman & Sumerlyda\n\u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fee Wulfgeat & Gyrping fundon \u00feam abbod \u00e6ddulfe \u00fea hi \u00feat lande guldun \u00e6t\n\u00deonne is an Hundulf, o\u00f0er is Ulf Doddes sune, III \u00feurlac, IIII Sigar, V \u00feurold on Macesige.\n\u00dees landes is under eal IX & XX gedale.\nOn \u00feissum gewrite cy\u00f0 hwet \u00fea festermen synd \u00fees landes ceapes \u00fee Adeluuold biscop gebohte \u00e6t\nEige \u00e6rest on Gyrewerde XXIIII \u00e6cera & \u00feerto god gebotl & him man sealde wi\u00f0 XII mancusas goldes\n& him weron festermen, Frena & Sigefer\u00f0 & Oggod.\n\u00dea bohte man \u00e6t Mannele & \u00e6t his wife LX \u00e6cera mid \u00ferim pundum & mid anum yre.\n& him weron festermen \u00feurlac, & Oggod.\n\u00dea bohte man \u00e6t Tuce & \u00e6t hire sune Clacce LX \u00e6cera \u00e6lc mid X penegum.\n& hire weron festermen Gunna & Hundulf & Saxa & \u00feurfer\u00f0.\n& \u00e6t \u00fean XX \u00e6cera \u00fea man bohte \u00e6t Vfige \u00e6lne mid XX penegun & mid VIII penegun.\n& him weron festermen Tunna his feder & Vlf & Osulfe.\n& \u00e6t is modur Aswige man bohte LX \u00e6cera elcne mid X penegun.\n& him weron festermen Wulgar & Eadric & Osfer\u00f0 & Styrcyr & \u00e6tlebrant.\n\u00deonne bohte man \u00e6t Wulno\u00f0e metere Oxanege.\n\u00deonne on Oxanige is ametenes wudes & feldes & medwe XXV \u00e6cera & wi\u00f0utan \u00fean ige sixti sticca\n\u00deer wi\u00f0utan & him man sealde wi\u00f0 Oxanige & wi\u00f0 \u00f0an \u00feer utan XXV mancussa goldes.\n& him weron festermen Gyreweard & \u00e6thelno\u00f0 \u00e6t\u00feelfer\u00f0es sune greatan & Wulno\u00f0es agen sune.\n\u00deonne is geseald wi\u00f0 Wy\u00f0eringaige & Oxanige XV pund.\n\u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00feere \u00fereore hyda \u00e6t \u00feeorp \u00fee Adeluuold biscop gebohte \u00e6t Sygefer\u00f0e mid XVI\n\u00deet is \u00feonne \u00e6rest Frena & \u00e6lsige & \u00e6lfno\u00f0 Badan sune & Osfer\u00f0 Fri\u00f0egistes sune & Hudeman &\n\u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fee Herulf Adan sune funde Aldulfe abbod & Goduine \u00e6lfsies sune \u00fea hi \u00feat\n\u00deas is \u00e6thestan Catlan sune & Leofsie \u00feurlaces sune & Tufes on Hylpestune & \u00e6\u00f0estan on Uptune &\n& \u00feis wes gedon \u00e6t Vndelum on \u00feere VIII hundreda gewytnesse.\n\u00deis synd \u00fea festermen \u00fee \u00e6incund funde \u00e6ldulfe abbod \u00e6t \u00fean lande \u00e6t Anlafestune \u00fee he \u00e6t him\n\u00deet is Eadric on Torp & E\u00f0estan Catlan sune & Tufes on Beornican & Tufes on Hylpestune & Leofsie\n\u00deis synd \u00fea borhhanda \u00fee Swuste & hire dohter funden \u00e6ldulfe abbod \u00e6t o\u00f0re \u00e6lfe hyde \u00e6t\n\u00deet wes Goduine \u00e6lfsies sune & \u00e6lfno\u00f0 \u00e6t Creast & Sumerlyda preost & Sumerlyda \u00e6t Stoce & Osulf\n\u00deis synd \u00fea Wynemannes lafe \u00e6t Randan funde \u00e6ldulfe abbod \u00e6t are hy\u00f0e \u00e6t Wermingtune.\n\u00deet is hyre agan sune an & hyre \u00fereo gebro\u00f0re Osulf & Fastolf & Beorneh & adeluuold Fry\u00f0egistes\n\u00deis is seo swutelung \u00fee \u00e6lfweard on Dentune wro\u00f0te wi\u00f0 Eadulf abbod \u00fea he him \u00feat land ag\u00e6f \u00e6t\n\u00deet is Frena & Osfer\u00f0 Fry\u00f0egystes sune & Adeluuold his bro\u00f0or & Sumerlyda preost & Osulf\n& on his wedde gesealde \u00feet land \u00e6t Wermingtune \u00e6fter his d\u00e6g into sancte Petre for his saule on",
